+   out after 1 second; individual SQL statements time out after 5 seconds. The development migration
+   completed in about 0.04 seconds. If blocked, let it abort and retry; do not disable the guards or
+   force CASCADE. A concurrent new user/tag/question/map row makes the archive stale too: take and
